<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Security — Psilocon Valley</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="How Psilocon Valley protects your business data, client information, and payments. Security practices, encryption, and privacy policy.">
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://psiloconvalley.com/security">
    {{template "nav-styles" .}}
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            background: #0a0f1a;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .page-wrapper {
            max-width: 860px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 80px 24px 120px;
        }

        /* ── Header ── */
        .sec-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
            background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(74,222,128,0.2);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .sec-title {
            font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .sec-title span {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ade80 0%, #22d3ee 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .sec-intro {
            font-size: 17px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 640px;
            margin-bottom: 72px;
        }

        /* ── Sections ── */
        .sec-section {
            margin-bottom: 64px;
            padding-bottom: 64px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        }
        .sec-section:last-of-type {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .sec-section-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(74,222,128,0.7);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .sec-section h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        /* ── Cards ── */
        .sec-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .sec-card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 22px 20px;
        }

        .sec-card-icon {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .sec-card h4 {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .sec-card p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ── Prose ── */
        .sec-prose {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .sec-prose + .sec-prose {
            margin-top: 16px;
        }

        /* ── Status table ── */
        .sec-status-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .sec-status-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .sec-status-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .sec-status-dot.green { background: #4ade80; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(74,222,128,0.5); }
        .sec-status-dot.yellow { background: #fbbf24; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(251,191,36,0.5); }

        .sec-status-name {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ffffff;
            min-width: 220px;
        }

        .sec-status-desc {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
        }

        /* ── CTA ── */
        .sec-cta {
            margin-top: 72px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 48px 32px;
            background: rgba(74,222,128,0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(74,222,128,0.15);
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .sec-cta h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .sec-cta p {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #0a0f1a;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #e2e8f0;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 24px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        }
        footer a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-decoration: none; }
        footer a:hover { color: #fff; }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .page-wrapper { padding: 60px 20px 80px; }
            .sec-status-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
            .sec-status-name { min-width: unset; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
{{template "nav" .}}

<div class="page-wrapper">

    <div class="sec-badge">🔒 Security Overview</div>

    <h1 class="sec-title">Your data is safe.<br><span>We built it that way.</span></h1>

    <p class="sec-intro">
        Psilocon Valley handles invoices, client data, and payments for independent businesses.
        Security is not a feature we added — it is the foundation we built on.
        Here is exactly what we do to protect you and your clients.
    </p>

    <!-- ── Authentication ── -->
    <div class="sec-section">
        <p class="sec-section-label">Authentication</p>
        <h2>How we protect your account</h2>
        <div class="sec-cards">
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">🔐</div>
                <h4>Argon2id Password Hashing</h4>
                <p>The strongest password hashing algorithm available. Your password is never stored — only an irreversible hash. Even we cannot read it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">✍️</div>
                <h4>HMAC-SHA256 Signed Sessions</h4>
                <p>Every session cookie is cryptographically signed. Forged or tampered cookies are rejected before they reach your account.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">⏱️</div>
                <h4>Rate Limiting</h4>
                <p>IP-based sliding window rate limiting blocks brute force attempts on login, registration, and password reset endpoints.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">🔑</div>
                <h4>Account Lockout</h4>
                <p>After 10 consecutive failed login attempts, the account is temporarily locked to prevent automated attacks.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">📧</div>
                <h4>Magic Link Reset</h4>
                <p>Password resets use single-use, time-limited magic links with cooldown periods to prevent abuse.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">🌐</div>
                <h4>Google OAuth</h4>
                <p>Sign in with Google delegates authentication to Google's infrastructure — no password stored on our side at all.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Transport & Infrastructure ── -->
    <div class="sec-section">
        <p class="sec-section-label">Transport &amp; Infrastructure</p>
        <h2>How we protect data in transit</h2>
        <div class="sec-cards">
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">🔒</div>
                <h4>HTTPS Everywhere</h4>
                <p>All traffic is encrypted with TLS. There is no HTTP fallback — ever.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">📌</div>
                <h4>HSTS Preloading</h4>
                <p>HTTP Strict Transport Security is enforced for 2 years, including subdomains, and submitted to browser preload lists.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">🧱</div>
                <h4>Hardened HTTP Headers</h4>
                <p>Content Security Policy, X-Frame-Options, Permissions-Policy, and Cross-Origin headers are set on every response.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-card">
                <div class="sec-card-icon">🛡️</div>
                <h4>CSRF Protection</h4>
                <p>Every form is protected with a cryptographic CSRF token. Cross-site request forgery attacks cannot succeed.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Payments ── -->
    <div class="sec-section">
        <p class="sec-section-label">Payments</p>
        <h2>How we protect your money</h2>
        <p class="sec-prose">
            All payments are processed by Stripe — the same infrastructure trusted by Amazon, Google, and millions of businesses worldwide.
            We never see, handle, or store card numbers, bank account details, or CVCs.
            Payment data goes directly from your client's browser to Stripe's servers.
        </p>
        <p class="sec-prose">
            Stripe is PCI DSS Level 1 certified — the highest level of payment security certification available.
            Our integration uses Stripe Connect, meaning your earnings are held and transferred
            directly by Stripe, not routed through our accounts.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Privacy ── -->
    <div class="sec-section">
        <p class="sec-section-label">Privacy</p>
        <h2>What we do not do</h2>
        <p class="sec-prose">
            We do not sell your data. We do not share your client list with anyone.
            We do not run Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any third-party advertising trackers.
            We do not use your invoice data to train AI models or for any purpose other than running the product you signed up for.
        </p>
        <p class="sec-prose">
            Your clients' names, emails, addresses, and payment history are yours.
            We hold them in trust. We protect them. We never monetize them.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Security Status ── -->
    <div class="sec-section">
        <p class="sec-section-label">Current Status</p>
        <h2>What is implemented today</h2>
        <div class="sec-status-list">
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot green"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">Argon2id password hashing</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">Active on all accounts</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot green"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">HMAC-SHA256 signed sessions</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">Active on all sessions</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot green"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">CSRF protection</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">Every form, every request</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot green"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">Rate limiting &amp; account lockout</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">All auth endpoints</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot green"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">HTTPS + HSTS</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">2 year enforcement, preload submitted</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot green"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">Hardened HTTP headers</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">CSP, X-Frame-Options, Permissions-Policy, COOP, CORP</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot green"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">Zero third-party trackers</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">No analytics, no ad pixels</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot green"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">Stripe payment processing</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">PCI DSS Level 1 — we never see card data</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot yellow"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">Audit logging</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">In progress — every action will be logged with timestamp and IP</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot yellow"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">Two-factor authentication</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">Planned — TOTP + SMS options</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sec-status-row">
                <div class="sec-status-dot yellow"></div>
                <div class="sec-status-name">Encryption at rest</div>
                <div class="sec-status-desc">Planned — PII field-level encryption</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Contact ── -->
    <div class="sec-section">
        <p class="sec-section-label">Contact</p>
        <h2>Found a vulnerability?</h2>
        <p class="sec-prose">
            If you discover a security issue, please report it responsibly.
            Email us directly at <a href="mailto:security@psiloconvalley.com" style="color: #4ade80;">security@psiloconvalley.com</a>.
            We take every report seriously and respond within 48 hours.
            We do not pursue legal action against good-faith security researchers.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ── CTA ── -->
    <div class="sec-cta">
        <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
        <p>Professional invoicing, built on a secure foundation. Free to start.</p>
        <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">Create Free Account →</a>
    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    <p>
        Built with Go + PostgreSQL —
        <a href="/research">Research</a> ·
        <a href="/tools">Tools</a> ·
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
    </p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
